cff-version: "1.2.0"
message: If you use this app, please cite it and the works it builds on, listed under references.
type: software
title: Spatial Niches
abstract: Spatial organization of labelled observations (cell types, deconvolved spot types or spatial domains)
  in spatial transcriptomics data - squidpy's neighbourhood enrichment, co-occurrence and interaction matrix per
  sample and pooled, and cellular niches as clusters of every observation's neighbourhood composition over all
  samples, with tables, a summary and figures for the workflow report.
authors:
- name: Pennsieve (University of Pennsylvania)
repository-code: https://github.com/pennsieve-apps/st-niches
license: Apache-2.0
